{"name":"Dumpling","hex":"#f7ddaa","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dumpling","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A ball of dough that is cooked and may have a filling and/or additional ingredients in the dough. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}\n Specifically, a ball of dough used in stews and other sauced dishes; a thick noodle.\n Specifically, a food composed of a dough wrapper around a filling.","Specifically, a ball of dough used in stews and other sauced dishes; a thick noodle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dumpling"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dumpling","blocks":[{"text":"Dumplings are a broad class of dishes that consist of pieces of cooked dough, often wrapped around a filling. The dough can be based on bread, wheat or other flours, or potatoes, and it may be filled with meat, fish, tofu, cheese, vegetables, or a combination. Dumplings may be prepared using a variety of cooking methods and are found in many world cuisines."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/HK_SYP_%E8%A5%BF%E7%87%9F%E7%9B%A4_Sai_Ying_Pun_Kwan_Yick_Building_%E5%90%8D%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E9%AE%AE%E9%85%92%E5%AE%B6_Star_Seafood_Restaurant_food_%E5%90%9E%E9%BA%B5_Wonton_dim_sum_October_2020_SS2_01.jpg/330px-HK_SYP_%E8%A5%BF%E7%87%9F%E7%9B%A4_Sai_Ying_Pun_Kwan_Yick_Building_%E5%90%8D%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E9%AE%AE%E9%85%92%E5%AE%B6_Star_Seafood_Restaurant_food_%E5%90%9E%E9%BA%B5_Wonton_dim_sum_October_2020_SS2_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dumpling"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Pelmeni_Russian.jpg/500px-Pelmeni_Russian.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Pelmeni_Russian.jpg/1280px-Pelmeni_Russian.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":